      <definition>2 [= suγud-] v. i. To be decided, determined; to make up one's mind.</definition>
      <page>700</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠢ ᠶᠠᠪᠤᠬᠤ ᠪᠡᠷ ᠰᠢᠭᠣᠳᠪᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>bi jabuxu ber --ba</transcript>
          <definition> I have made up my mind to go</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠠᠨᠳᠤᠬᠤ ᠵᠠᠮ ᠳ᠋‍‍ᠤ‍ᠷ ᠰᠢᠭᠣᠳᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>manduxu zam dur --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To go straight up the road of prosperity.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠰᠡᠳᠺᠢᠯ ᠰᠢᠭᠣᠳᠬᠤ</unicode>
